# Data Processing Guidelines

## Data Structure
- **Input Images**: [data/dataset/](mdc:data/dataset/) - Raw dataset images
- **Processed Data**: Split into train/val/test directories
- **CSV Files**: Layout annotations and saliency boxes
- **Preprocessing**: [code/data_process/](mdc:code/data_process/) - Data preprocessing scripts

## Key Processing Scripts
- **Data Splits**: [code/data_process/data_splits/split_data.py](mdc:code/data_process/data_splits/split_data.py)
- **Dataloader**: [code/data_process/dataloader.py](mdc:code/data_process/dataloader.py)
- **Saliency Detection**: [code/data_process/saliency_detection.py](mdc:code/data_process/saliency_detection.py)
- **Inpainting**: [code/data_process/generate_inpaint_img.py](mdc:code/data_process/generate_inpaint_img.py)

## Saliency Models
- **BASNet**: [code/data_process/models/saliency/basnet.py](mdc:code/data_process/models/saliency/basnet.py)
- **ISNet**: [code/data_process/models/saliency/isnet.py](mdc:code/data_process/models/saliency/isnet.py)
- **Weights**: [data/model_weights/saliency_detection/](mdc:data/model_weights/saliency_detection/)

## Data Formats
- **Images**: PNG format for processed images
- **Layouts**: CSV format with bounding box coordinates
- **Saliency**: Binary masks and saliency boxes
- **Intent Maps**: Design intent detection results

## Preprocessing Pipeline
1. Image resizing and normalization
2. Saliency detection and box generation
3. Layout annotation processing
4. Train/validation/test splits
5. Data augmentation (if applicable)